WEBVTT

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.986
And it's prohibitively expensive

00:00:31.986 --> 00:00:37.492
to launch tons and tons
of construction materials into space.

00:00:38.284 --> 00:00:43.331
So to realize a pioneering habitat

00:00:43.372 --> 00:00:45.958
that progressively grows,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.130
adapts and expands
into a permanent outpost,

00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:54.884
we have to think differently
about how we build.

00:00:55.718 --> 00:00:59.347
These habitats
and the robots that build them

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:03.476
will enable humanity to thrive off-world.